SUMMARY:Helium Presents: Rock Bottom
LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 2031 Sansom Street\, Philadelphia
DESCRIPTION:Come be a part of the worst gig ever.\n\nThe cover band HUGE IN
  EUROPE rocks. And they’re here to play some of your favorite sing-along 
 anthems… if they can only get a word in edgewise. Unfortunately for them\
 , drama is brewing around the club that hilariously interrupts the show whe
 n you’ll least expect it. In this immersive music and comedy experience\,
  come have some drinks and sing along with your favorite songs. But be prep
 ared for some behind-the-scenes shenanigans to spill out onto stage and all
  around the club. You’ll laugh. You’ll sing. You’ll never guess what 
 happens next. Featuring the band Huge in Europe and some of Philly’s funn
 iest comedians. Created by Marc Grossman and Chip Chantry.\n\nCouples Packa
 ge includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit ($45 per pe
 rson)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Protection\n\nManagement reserves the right to 
 prevent customers from entering the facility who they deem disruptive or da
 ngerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/
 event/helium-presents-rock-bottom/
